      "content": "The feeling of exhaustion when your old self feels like it's decaying is incredibly real and deeply painful. When the core of who you were feels lost, the idea of simply letting go can sound like the only restful option. Please consider that this feeling of \"peace\" might actually be the exhaustion talking, not a true resolution. Talking to someone who understands existential feelings can help you explore these heavy thoughts without rushing to any final conclusion.",
